// deliberately broken: a predicate must write its parentheses, and this file
// spells a nullary one bare in DECLARATION position. The three other positions
// are rejected too, each in its own file-scope pass:
//
//   use in a formula   `base`     → 'base' is a predicate — write 'base()'
//   schema parameter   `(q)`      → a schema parameter needs its kind
//   inside a body      `q`        → reported at the INSTANTIATION, since a
//                                   schema's body is only elaborated where it
//                                   is used (see `KEYWORD: schematic`)
//
// Only the declaration error is asserted here — it fires at parse time and so
// suppresses the rest of the file.
pred base
